record.content:
Quaternions can be defined from the axis angle of rotation by

\begin{equation}
\left[ \begin{array}{c}
q_1 \\
q_2 \\
q_3 \\
q_4 \end{array} \right] =
\left[ \begin{array}{c}
e_1 sin( \alpha /2 ) \\
e_2 sin( \alpha /2  )  \\
e_3 sin( \alpha /2  )  \\
cos( \alpha /2 )   \end{array} \right]
\end{equation}
